WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:02.430
Welcome to Water Workforce 360.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.650
Today you will record application steps

3
00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:06.570
so your team can follow a real

4
00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:07.510
procedure.

5
00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:10.200
Open Document Studio from Content.

6
00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:12.520
Choose Record tutorial.

7
00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:13.810
Pick a capture mode.

8
00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:16.190
Screen plus mic works for most plant

9
00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:17.000
walkthroughs.

10
00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:18.920
Screenshots only works when video is

11
00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:19.430
blocked.

12
00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:20.590
Start recording.

13
00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:22.080
Click through the application the way

14
00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:22.980
you would on the job.

15
00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:24.730
Each click becomes a step.

16
00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.570
Stop when the procedure is done.

17
00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:28.050
Review the step list.

18
00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:29.370
Fix captions.

19
00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:31.140
Add callouts where someone might get

20
00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:31.740
stuck.

21
00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:34.050
Generate the written guide, then save or

22
00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:35.750
submit for your manager to publish.

23
00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:37.710
That tutorial now lives in your district

24
00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:38.350
library.

25
00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:40.240
Staff can replay it anytime.

26
00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:42.290
Partners can also ship short avatar

27
00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:44.680
videos for the same topic when you want

28
00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:46.240
a face-to-camera overview.

29
00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:48.820
You just turned tribal knowledge into a

30
00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:49.700
reusable lesson.
